Description: remap Galaxy XR hardware buttons to mouse buttons
 Two small evdev/uinput daemons that grab the headset's hardware inputs and
 re-emit them through virtual mouse devices:
 .
  * keys-remap: power button to left click, volume down to F13, volume up
    to right click.
  * touchkey-remap: sec_touchkey touch held to left button held.
 .
 It targets the Samsung Galaxy XR platform running Ubuntu on its Android
 vendor kernel.
